"""Platform A: monitoring and alerting, telemetry collectors, logs, traces, CI and Git hosting, delivery (CD), artifact registries and BI.

Control-plane and tooling products: no `cap`, no `workload` trait. The trait `monitoring` is given only to products that collect metrics and
alert on them (it satisfies HA-OBS-01); an alert router, an on-call service or a log shipper does not carry it. A service the provider runs is
`saas`; a self-hosted product says what is single in it (a controller, a database, a shared file system) and what the user has to protect.
"""
from forge import *

